<div class="block block-layout-builder block-inline-blockcomponent-text nsf-component">
  <section class="text__container">

  
    

      <div class="body-1"><p>The National Science Board establishes the policies of the U.S. National Science Foundation and serves as advisor to Congress and the president.</p></div>
  
      <div class="text__content text-formatted"><p><span>The board approves major NSF awards, provides congressional testimony and issues statements relevant to the nation's science and engineering enterprise.</span></p></div>
  
</section>
</div>


